---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Utah Oasis Homes | Custom Home Builder"
  description="Learn how Utah Oasis Homes approaches custom home design and construction through careful listening, purposeful decisions, and clear communication."
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h1 class="section-title">About Utah Oasis Homes</h1>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        We create thoughtfully designed homes that feel personal, restorative, and deeply connected to
        the way you live.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card about-intro-card">
      <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--muted);">
        With more than 25 years of construction experience, Utah Oasis Homes creates distinctive
        custom homes shaped around each client’s vision, lifestyle, and setting. Our work is guided
        by a hands-on approach, honest communication, thoughtful planning, and close attention to
        detail.
      </p>

      <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 1rem;">
        From the first conversation through completion, we focus on making the building experience
        clear, collaborative, and carefully managed—resulting in a home that feels personal,
        enduring, and unmistakably yours.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="about-principles-title">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2 class="section-title" id="about-principles-title">What Guides the Work</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        A thoughtful home begins with listening carefully and making each decision with purpose.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card-grid">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Listen First</h3>
        <p>
          Your priorities, routines, and vision shape the direction of the home from the beginning.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h3>Design with Purpose</h3>
        <p>
          Every room, view, and material should contribute to how the home feels and functions.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h3>Build with Care</h3>
        <p>
          Clear communication and careful execution help turn a thoughtful design into a lasting
          home.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
